  "body": "In the [query the \"bluetooth\" permission algorithm](https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#query-the-bluetooth-permission) before `Step 6.2` I think there should be a check with calling the [canonicalization](https://webbluetoothcg.github.io/web-bluetooth/#bluetoothlescanfilterinit-canonicalizing) on each filter in `desc.filters`, to prevent using not valid filters or passing blocklisted services. If any of these calls return with an error, propagate that error and abort the steps. Otherwise use the results of the canonicalization to match a filter in `Step 6.2`.\r\n",
